*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Li'l Zyclone]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Dread Bore]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 80~86.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,600f</sup>.
